  "id": "health-anxiety",
  "term": "health anxiety",
  "definition": "Health anxiety is excessive worry about being ill, along with increased attention to normal or minor bodily sensations as possible signs of illness. It may be linked with lower physical activity and symptoms such as low back pain.",
